      "description": "Shared tick for States $00/$02/$10: checks $FF19A7 dismissal (-> 0x012BA8), dispatches $FF19A2 (1->0x012608, 2->0x0125CA, 3->0x01263C), and branches to 0x012950 if State==$10. Otherwise saves +$16 in +$B2, scans 4 facings [f, (f+1)&3, (f-1)&3, f^2] via 0x00BAB8 with $0586E8 -> enters State $10 (0x012672) on first hit else restores +$16=+$B2. Calls 0x012BFE & 0x012C32. In State $00: if +$9E==0, calls 0x00E398 and computes Chebyshev max(|dx|,|dy|); <= $40 PRNG wander turn (0x00E268 >= $7FFF -> +/-(1) mod 4), <= $80 face Ali, > $80 enter State $02 (0x01268C); else sets +$9E=30 ($1E) and speed (0x100,0x100) via 0x00E2D4. While +$9E!=0, oscillates +$4E/+$52 by +/-$2000 (+$9E>$0F vs <=$0F) into +$72/+$76. In State $02: clears +$2A, computes ($28,$20) behind-Ali offset with Z-delta y-compensation, calls 0x00E45E (d4==0 -> State 0/+9E=0/stop; 1<=d4<=4 -> 1x vel; d4>4 -> 2x vel) with 4-frame facing debounce +$AC."
    },
