      "description": "0x012BA8 sets $FF19A7=$FF, State $06, +$2A=6, facing 2, +$38|=8, +$36&=~2, +$A2=$FF, plays SFX #$A0039E via 0x00E7FC, clears *(+$A6) if == $FFFE ($FF1C1C flame slot), and clears +$06. 0x012BF0 (State $06) despawns +$00=0 on +$37 bit 1. 0x012BFE tracks ali_z14 + 16 ($10) using +$14(a6) (falling back to ali_z14 if < 0), stepping +$10.w by +1 if delta < 0 or -1 only if delta > 12 ($0C) and +$10.w > 0. 0x012C32 reads +$30(a6) >> 1 into 4-word table at 0x012C46..0x012C4E (0x7000, 0x3000, 0x9000, 0xD000), sign-extends, doubles, and adds to 32-bit +$10(a6).",
